OL,3,GNEWSAMan who used police ruse to
OL,4,Aassault girls jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who pretended to be a police
OL,7,Fofficer in order to sexually assault
OL,8,Ftwo teenagers has been jailed.
OL,10,FAaron Grimshaw, 23, of Mountview Park,
OL,11,FLisburn, approached two 16-year-old
OL,12,Fgirls at Tutshill Recreation Ground in
OL,13,FGloucestershire on 22 May and said he
OL,14,Fneeded to search them, threatening to
OL,15,Fcall their parents if they refused.
OL,17,FGrimshaw then inappropriately touched
OL,18,Fthe teenagers under their clothing but
OL,19,Fstopped when their friends gathered
OL,20,Faround and began recording him. He was
OL,21,Farrested later that day.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
