OL,3,GNEWSAMan who used police ruse to
OL,4,Aassault girls jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared at Bradford Crown Court on
OL,7,F17 September, having pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Ftwo charges of sexual assault, and he
OL,9,Fwas jailed for a year.
